<card id="c" title="Big O Notation Guide for Beginners">
<do type="prev" label="Back"><prev/></do>
<p mode="nowrap">const fibonacci = function (num) {<br/>&#160;&#160;if (num &lt;= 1) {<br/>&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;return num;<br/>&#160;&#160;}<br/>&#160;&#160;return fibonacci(num - 2) + fibonacci(num - 1);<br/>};<br/>fibonacci(5); //true</p>
<p mode="wrap"><b>O(log n)</b></p>
<p><b>Example:</b></p>
<p mode="wrap"><a href="/wap/eng/guide-to-Big-O-notation-7.wml">&lt;&lt; Prev</a> | 8/11 | <a href="/wap/eng/guide-to-Big-O-notation-9.wml">Next &gt;&gt;</a><br/><a href="/wap/eng.wml">English</a><br/><a href="/wap/index.wml">Home</a></p>
</card>
